// Pre-template directives for gum::KTBNInference. Must be %include'd BEFORE
// aGrUM_wrap_KTBN.i's %template (KTBNInference).
//
// posteriors() returns `const std::vector<Tensor<GUM_SCALAR>>&`, whose
// nested template type passForPyType.py cannot render as a valid Python
// type hint (produces a syntactically broken generated .py). Ignored here
// using the fully-instantiated name, mirroring the proven working precedent
// in swigsrc/causal.i (`%ignore gum::CausalImpact<double>::getResult;`,
// also pre-template) rather than markovRandomField_after_templates.i's
// post-template %ignore+%extend convention, which -- empirically, for this
// method -- does not actually suppress the native wrapper.
%ignore gum::KTBNInference<double>::posteriors;
